WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.089
Which inspection instruction is your team
using?

00:00:03.417 --> 00:00:04.741
Is it even the current one?

00:00:05.178 --> 00:00:09.591
With ICC Documents, see which instructions
are due for review and start a

00:00:09.591 --> 00:00:11.458
new revision from the same record.

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:15.328
Say final inspection needs an extra check
before release.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.893
Send the revised instruction for approval.

00:00:18.287 --> 00:00:21.632
Once it's approved, set the effective date
and publish it.

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:25.895
Your team can find the current copy, and
you can see who approved it and

00:00:25.895 --> 00:00:27.002
when it took effect.

00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:31.263
Link it to final inspection so it's easy
to find where the work happens.

00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:35.456
Book a documents demo with ISO
Certification Consultants.
